++# Phase 2 spec: the sync reads the latest dev-tools
++
++## 1. Status
++
++Owner-decided (2026-11-23), by delegated approval (auto=true); recorded below, under
++"Owner gate". Phase 1 is recorded (`002-phase-1.md`). Implementation may begin.
