++  (`001-plan.md`): section 2 ("Phase 2"), section 4 ("Phase 2", P2.1 to P2.7, P2.3b),
++  sections 5, 6 (K3 to K8) and 9; D8 (the owner's "Yes, by default"), D9, D10 and D12.
