++| O6 | `--as-is`: no fetch; a checkout behind is delivered as it is (P2.5, D10) | T9 |
++| O7 | `compare` and `apply --dry-run` name the same files (P2.6) | T10 |
++| O8 | A source folder inside another repository is not fetched (P2.7, K8) | T11 |
